<title>UK: BNG sets one billion guilder Eurobond due 2007.</title>
<headline>BNG sets one billion guilder Eurobond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    19.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.425   PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FEES	 2.00	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+15.3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
